<div id="oae-statement"
     class="html container mt-3 mb-5">
  <p class="discreet">
    Penn State College of Ag Sciences is committed to providing access to 
    programs and opportunities to all qualified students without regard 
    to race, color, religion, age, sex, sexual orientation, gender 
    identity, national origin, disability or protected veteran status.
